 {
  "heading": "Purpose",
  "paragraphs": [
   "This is the outline of the of Pro-Vizi provisioning endpoints for the GreenShield platform. By specifying a supported function and providing the necessary data, Pro-Vizi interacts with the GreenShield platform to perform actions without the need for UI interaction or human intervention.",
   "Here Greenshield values are broken by site functionality."
  ],
  "examples": [
   "Example GreenShield add-single payload",
   "Example GreenShield add-family payload",
   "Example GreenShield search-member payload",
   "Example GreenShield terminate payload"
  ]
 },
 {
  "heading": "GreenShield Endpoint (EP) Url"
 },
 {
  "heading": "Functions",
  "paragraphs": [
   "The GreenShield endpoint (EP) supports the following functions:"
  ],
  "table": [
   ["Function", "Purpose"],
   ["add-single", "Add a single member to the system (no dependents)"],
   ["add-family", "Add a single member plus dependents (child/spouse)"],
   ["search-member", "Search the system for a member and return their information"],
   ["terminate", "Terminate a member from the system"]
  ]
 },
 {
  "heading": "General Structure",
  "paragraphs": [
   "Each payload requires four common parameters in addition to function-specific information:"
  ],
  "table": [
   ["Parameter", "Data Type", "Function"],
   ["API-Key", "Text String", "Ideabytes vided Pro-Vizi API key"],
   ["username", "Text String", "GreenShield account username"],
   ["password", "Text String", "GreenShield account password"],
   ["function", "Text String", "Desired website function"]
  ]
 },
