  "heading": "search",
  "paragraphs": [
    "Note: The search object is necessary for information cross-verification. To ensure a member is successfully enrolled in the system, a search for the member is performed after provisioning and the member’s certificate information is returned. For all functions, providing the member’s first name in addition to default values is sufficient."
